  "goodToKnow": "Die Altersgruppe is an age group: in allen Altersgruppen, die Altersgruppe der Über-80-Jährigen. In sport and statistics, Altersklasse is also used. Das Alter means age and old age: im Alter (in old age). Die Altersgrenze is an age limit, and German elections set the voting age at 18 (16 for EU elections since 2024 and in some state and local elections). Plural: die Altersgruppen."
